unsloth — design and mathematics reference only; NO CODE COPIED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Upstream:       https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth
License:        Apache-2.0 at the top level, with AGPLv3 and LGPL-3.0-or-later
                carve-outs over parts of the tree.

learning-llamas uses unsloth as a *design and mathematics* reference only. No code
from unsloth is copied into this repository, from any file, under any license.
Kernel mathematics (for example the chunked-attention backward formulation and
the sparse cross-entropy gradient derivation) is reimplemented from first
principles with unsloth's published approach as prior art.

The AGPL/LGPL carve-outs are enumerated verbatim in docs/PROVENANCE.md; a naive
"grep for AGPL" over the unsloth tree misses several of them, which is why the
exclusion list is written down rather than rediscovered per pull request.
